meta {
  name: Validate Referral Code
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{host}}/api/v1/referral-code/validate?code=PETROVIS2026&event_id=1e2d6522-8339-4a92-9bf4-7453ddaa7a29
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  ## Description
  Validates a referral code without consuming it. Returns pricing information and remaining usage count.

  ## Authentication
  - None (public endpoint)

  ## Query Parameters
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |-----------|------|----------|-------------|
  | code | string | Yes | Referral code to validate |
  | event_id | string | No | Event UUID (defaults to Petrovis event if omitted) |

  ## Success Response (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "success validate referral code",
    "data": {
      "is_valid": true,
      "code": "PETROVIS2026",
      "final_price": 180000,
      "original_price": 250000,
      "discount": 0,
      "remaining_uses": 3,
      "message": "Referral code is valid"
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Invalid Code Response (200 - still success, but is_valid: false)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "success validate referral code",
    "data": {
      "is_valid": false,
      "message": "Referral code not found"
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Error Responses
  | Status | Message |
  |--------|---------|
  | 400 | code parameter is required |

  ## Example Usage
  ```
  # Check if PETROVIS2026 is valid
  GET /api/v1/referral-code/validate?code=PETROVIS2026

  # Check for specific event
  GET /api/v1/referral-code/validate?code=PETROVIS2026&event_id=1e2d6522-8339-4a92-9bf4-7453ddaa7a29
  ```
}
